      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُكْفَّرٌ</span></b>  A bird <i>covered with feathers.</i> (A.) See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَافِرٌ</span>: and see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكْفُورٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  One <i>who, though
beneficent, is regarded,</i> or <i>treated, with ingratitude;</i> (K;) a benefactor <i>whose beneficence
is not gratefully acknowledged.</i> (A.)

